simscan/apartment.py contains code adapted from ProcTHOR
(https://github.com/allenai/procthor), Copyright Allen Institute for AI,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  procthor/generation/floorplan_generation.py  (select_room, grow_rect,
                                                grow_l_shape, expand_rooms,
                                                recursive MetaRoom expansion)
  procthor/generation/interior_boundaries.py    (corner cuts of the boundary)
  procthor/generation/doors.py                  (door ordering rules)
The algorithm follows Lopes et al., "A Constrained Growth Method for Procedural
Floor Plan Generation" (2010).
